window.products.push({"id":534082,"name":"3D Area Rug Floor Mat,3D Round Carpet ,3D Optical Illusion Rug,Black White Plaid Visual Vortex Bottomless Hole Non Slip Non-Woven Doormat for Living R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bS6Z4Zv9L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✎......【Unique 3D Design】：This uniquely designed whirlpool carpet incorporates some fashion elements, using illusion and black and white checked patterns to make you feel like you are about to fall into a black hole. This will be the most eye-catching design decoration in your home, so that your family and friends can remember it immediately and make your home more tasteful. ✎......【Non-slip Back And Used Safely】: The back using point plastic particle design, effective increase and ground friction, efficient anti-slip wear resistance, increase air permeability, prevent the floor from moisture to your life has brought great convenience, you can rest assured safe use it. And this carpet is very soft, it relieves tired foot muscles, keeps you away from the cold floor, and gives you a good mood. ✎......【High Quality Material And Very Environmental Protection】: High quality soft polyester + crystal velvet. Soft and comfortable fabric, strong elasticity, anti - static. Exquisite workmanship, sealing edge tight sewing, firm and thick, soft and elastic feel, soaking up air. Environmentally friendly and durable. Carpet color is complete, do not fade, cannot afford ball, more convenient to use, the bottom does not hurt the floor, can be used continuously. ✎......【Wide Application】: This carpet is resistant to abrasion and dirt, suitable for indoor and outdoor floors and chairs on tables. Suitable for any room, including study, bedroom, living room, dining room, tea table, hall, bedside, bathroom door, entrance door, kitchen, cloakroom, corridor, etc., it is a necessary good thing for nursery, family, office, coffee shop, etc ✎......【Easy To Clean And Care For】: Our carpets are easy to clean, either by washing in a washing machine or by hand. Add a mild detergent to the carpet and gently clear the carpet by hand. Then leave the carpet to dry in a ventilated area, not exposed to direct sunlight. You can also clean the floor 1-2 times a week. You can use a vacuum cleaner or a dry cloth to wipe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bS6Z4Zv9L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"snow keychain","source_asin":"B08GL9G7G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GL9G7G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GL9G7G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534083,"name":"Sand Pendulum - Pit & Pendulum Garden. Cherry Wood Finish, 15 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NtsIPlZgL._AC_.jpg","description":"An ingenious take on a scientific principle that's just as fascinating today as it was when Galileo first studied it! When touched, the suspended weight swings freely under the influence of gravity, creating fantastic, unique designs in the sand! Handsome desktop decor with cherry-finish base. Great executive stress reliever and conversation piece! 15\" tall. Mesmerizing and addictive! More than an elegant desktop execu-toy (although it is that too!) The Pit and Pendulum demonstrates real science. -- Secured in its oak stand, the all metal pendulum converts kinetic energy into potential energy. The extremely fine sand (included) provides minimal friction allowing the pendulum to swing for extended periods of time. As the pendulum swings it gently \"writes\" ever changing geometic patterns in the sand. The patterns get bigger then smaller then bigger again as the arc of the pendulum also changes. -- Comes with a 14\" cherry stand with bowl-type base, bag of sand, and instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NtsIPlZgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Relaxus","source_asin":"B00E3UNHHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E3UNHHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E3UNHHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
