window.products.push({"id":534127,"name":"Bath Toy Organizer Set - 2 Extra Large Mesh Bags - 6 Extra Strong Grip Lock Suction Cup Hooks (White) - Easy Storage of Bath Toys and Other Bathroom I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GfqKWeatL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set contains 2 extra large mesh bags for easy storage of bath toys and 6 hooks with extra strong suction cups (white). Both mesh bags not only allow easy storage of bath toys, they also allows toys to dry and prevent them from becoming slimy or molded. You can also use the mesh bags to store and organize other things than bath toys, for example shampoo, lotion, shaving cream, etc. A great solution for kids and parents. All six suction cups are equipped with grip lock hooks that assure an extra strong connection to many different flat surfaces, such as ceramic tiles, glass and plastic. Much stronger and durable than standard suction cups. The extra strong suction cups are designed for use with the mesh net bags, but can also be used to hang other items, for example towels, washcloths, sponges, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GfqKWeatL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kare & Kind","source_asin":"B01M3RDDRA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3RDDRA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3RDDRA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534128,"name":"TREONYIA 6 in 1 Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer, Expandable Drawer Organizer to Declutter Your Kitchen, Premium Dispenser Compatible with Gallon, Quart,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L4-CglCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Expandable Super Big Space】Our ziplock bag storage organizers are tailor-made for drawers and tabletops, with extra-long extension capability to accommodate drawers of different sizes. (13\" to 19.5\"W). Contains 4 pieces of zipping lock bag container ＆ 2 wrap dispensers, It'll help keep your food bags and Kitchen Roll neat, making the kitchen clutter-free and more organized. 【Magnetic Design & Custom Labels】Our bag storage organizer features a unique magnetic suction design that easily opens the lid, making filling super easy and avoiding forcing small openings that can cause bag deformation and clutter. Comes with 14 clear labels for you to mark and update each slot as needed to help you quickly find the right storage bags. 【Storage & High Compatibility】Bag Storage and Wrap Dispenser 6 IN 1 design, meets all your needs. This storage bag organizer is designed to hold any bag such as Gallons, Quarts, Sandwiches, Candy bags, Snacks, and various size bags. This kitchen organization and storage cabinet has 2 holes on the back so you can hang it on the wall, put it in a drawer or place it on a table anywhere you want. 【Natural High-Quality Bamboo】Made of 100% natural bamboo, the added coating on the surface makes it easy to clean and maintain, and durable. Tight bonding process, through careful polishing, the food storage bag organizer has a smooth surface without barbs and a safe design. The perfect replacement for plastic and cardboard boxes to keep your kitchen neat and tidy and make life healthier and easier! 【Considerate Design】Two side retractable foil dispensers for cling film, plastic wrap, foil, and waxed paper or cutlery such as knives and forks, equipped with two small wooden sticks reinforced to prevent the cling film from sliding off. 2 slots have two-way sliding cutters to ensure smooth cutting of wraps. The high quality hinges can withstand repeated opening and closing. Simple design, durable, convenient and elegant, a very good choice for families!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L4-CglCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TREONYIA","source_asin":"B0BJK3DYG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJK3DYG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJK3DYG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
