window.products.push({"id":534292,"name":"【Official Authentic】 RENPHO True HEPA Replacement Filter for RP-AP089W/RP-AP089B, 5-Stage Filtration System, Air Quality Monitor, Smart Auto Mode, Esp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7197C+i3eSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FITS FOR RENPHO TRUE HEPA AIR PURIFIER MODEL: RP-AP089W AND RP-AP089B. ESPECIALLY FOR PET HAIR. The replacement indicator flashes in red to remind you to replace the air filter. We highly recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months depending on the usage frequency and the air quality to ensure the best results. Search for RP-AP089-F1/ RP-AP089-F1-2/ RP-AP089-F2 for GENUINE Replacement filter. HIGH PERFORMANCE: The RENPHO air purifier for home large room refreshes the air 5x per hour in rooms as large as 480 ft² / 44 m², cleans rooms up to 960 ft² in just 24 minutes. It's perfect for living rooms, kitchens, bedrooms, offices, restaurants, hotels, and more! TRUE HEPA AIR PURIFIER: RENPHO Air Cleaners features a advanced 5-stage filtration system and 360-degree air outlet design. The Pre-Filter, Intercept Coating, True HEPA Filter, Activated Carbon Filter and Net Filter capture small airborne particles such as pet dander, pet hair, pollen, dust. Ideal for Pet Owners. SMART AUTO MODE WITH REAL-TIME AIR QUALITY MONITOR: In smart auto mode, the air purifier for home will automatically adjust the fan speed based on real-time air quality. 4 fan speed settings to meet different air quality and personal needs. Undisturbed SLEEP MODE & 4 TIMER & LOCK SET: The air cleaner for large room purify the air with only 26 dB in sleep mode, suitable for a restful and soothing indoor environment, helping you sleep deeply. LED display will all be turned off so it won't keep you awake at night. The timer setting will automatically shut off after 2, 4, 6 or 8 hours for your convenience. Child lock prevents error operations caused by pets or children and let them play freely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7197C+i3eSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RENPHO","source_asin":"B08NVHNCYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVHNCYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVHNCYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
