window.products.push({"id":534362,"name":"Prepworks by Progressive Assorted Dip Clips - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XBNh19FmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Prepworks by Progressive Set of 4 Mini Side Bowls in bright colors clip on plates to use for salsa, dips, dressings and condiments. Soft grip buttons securely clings onto rim of plate, including paper plates. Great for kids and adults, 1/3-cup capacity and dishwasher safe. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XBNh19FmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B004S67ULE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004S67ULE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004S67ULE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534363,"name":"Tgzwme Reed Curtain Bamboo Blind Light Filtering Roller Shades,47\" W x 71\" H Retro Bamboo Roll Up Window,Natural Reed Roll Up Window Blind for Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xxJBxCN0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【70 % LIGHT BLOCKAGE & ADDED PRIVACY】 - Roll up Reed shade blocks out most sun heat while allowing 30% gentle light to come in, concealing the view from the outside while offering soft light.Bamboo window shade is necessary for reading, sleeping or working, without putting your space in dull dark. 【KEEP YOUR SPACE COOLER】- When the privacy blinds roll up is mounted, are able to block sun heat, protecting you from the sun while bringing down the indoor temperature, keeping your room cooler in scorching summer day. 【EASY TO INSTALL】- 1. Measure the distance between 2 metal hangers on the reed blind. 2. Mark 2 points according to step 1 then drill 2 holes. 3. Hang up the retro bamboo roll up shade. 4. Roll up the bamboo shades by pulling down the pull cord if necessary. (Note: please lock it in place by pulling the cord to the right side) 【ABOUT SIZING】- Natural bamboo roller blinds size: 47 (W) x 71 (H) inches. To ensure the size fits your window. Please read the size info. carefully before purchasing. If your window is large in size, it’s recommended to get 2 natural reed window or more pieces. 【LONGER LIFESPAN & WIDE USES】- Sturdy roll up bamboo shades for windows patio won’t crack, tear or fade easily like aluminum blind, lasting for years. Hang this reed blinds over your Patio, Gazebo, Bedroom, Study, Conference Room, Balcony, Kitchen or any place that you need to have shade. 【Warm Tips】- We will do a good job of checking the roll up bamboo blinds before shipping, if you receive any broken or less accessories, which may be caused by the logistics in transit, you can contact us immediately. We will definitely deal with it in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xxJBxCN0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tgzwme","source_asin":"B0B3S53LLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3S53LLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3S53LLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534364,"name":"Dakine Lunch Box 5L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BWsdmvRTL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dakine Lunch Box is the perfect size soft-sided cooler ready to transport your cold lunch or snacks on its own or drop it right into your pack. Founded in Hawaii in 1979 and located at the base of Mt. Hood in Hood River, Oregon, Dakine builds backpacks, travel bags, and accessories, outerwear and clothing for people who love to surf, snowboard, skateboard, mountain bike, ski, windsurf, kiteboard and travel. Progress Is In Our DNA We're challenging you to chase the unknown. To push against predictable and break away from comfort - to surf new breaks, ride steeper terrain, go where the wind howls and the trails push past the horizon. To go where you've never gone, do what you've never done and revel in the experience. We'll be right there with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BWsdmvRTL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dakine","source_asin":"B09ZGCPS5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZGCPS5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZGCPS5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
