window.products.push({"id":534424,"name":"Polaris 9300 Sport Robotic In Ground Pool Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+9DTTN4OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The new and improved Polaris 3900 Vac-Sweep Sport delivers unmatched vacuum power, incomparable convenience and legendary performance. It integrates Polaris Classic series features you love with new enhancements for added durability, reliability and a performance you can count on. At a Glance Works in all in-ground pools; requires Polaris booster pump Works in all in-ground pools; requires Polaris booster pump Ready to connect to 1.5-inch dedicated pressure cleaner line Ready to connect to 1.5-inch dedicated pressure cleaner line Includes 31-feet of feed hose Includes 31-feet of feed hose Most vacuum power of any 3-jet Polaris cleaner, with 40 GPM of additional pool filtration through the filter bag Most vacuum power of any 3-jet Polaris cleaner, with 40 GPM of additional pool filtration through the filter bag 50% more torque with the all-wheel PosiDrive system with stainless steel chain 50% more torque with the all-wheel PosiDrive system with stainless steel chain Now includes TailSweep Pro, providing ultimate sweeping action, while eliminating water from spraying outside the pool Now includes TailSweep Pro, providing ultimate sweeping action, while eliminating water from spraying outside the pool Legendary Performance The Polaris 3900 Sport combines the dynamic appeal of a completely re-engineered body design with the most sophisticated features, which produces maximum vacuum power and drive torque for quicker cleaning and fewer hang-ups. The 3900 Sport features an all-wheel PosiDrive system with a durable stainless steel drive chain with 50 percent more torque for maximum speed and performance. Incomparable Convenience Clean easily and less often! Equipped with a dual-chamber, zippered SuperBag, the Polaris 3900 Sport picks up and stores more debris than other cleaners. It also features a unique auto-reverse technology, which enables it to free itself if it gets stuck. The 3900 Sport pressure cleaner works in all in-ground pools and requires a booster pump. It supplements the pool's filtration system by circulating an additional 40 gallons of water per minute through its filter bag. Extreme Sweeping The 3900 Sport now includes TailSweep PRO, an advanced sweep hose that blows debris out of corners and hard to reach places. TailSweep PRO also keeps water from spraying outside of your pool. No more wet windows or walkways! Unmatched Power The 3900 Sport is powered by a booster pump (sold separately, such as the PB4-60), giving it the most vacuum power of any cleaner. It will pick up even the largest debris, while filtering and circulating water for a cleaner, clearer pool in less time. Combine the 3900 Sport with the PB4-60 booster pump for maximum performance. About Polaris Polaris cleaners are the number one recognized brand of pool cleaners worldwide and have enjoyed 40 years as the top selling pressure pool cleaner. The new robotics from Polaris display the same high quality engineering, rugged construction, and reliability that pool owners have come to expect from the brand. Polaris Pool is part of the Zodiac Pool Systems, Inc. family of products for the pool and spa. What’s in the Box 3900 Sport Pressure-side pool cleaner; 31-foot hose kit; inline back-up valve; operating instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+9DTTN4OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zodiac","source_asin":"B0037AF3FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0037AF3FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0037AF3FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
