window.products.push({"id":534542,"name":"Brentwood Home Sierra Gel Memory Foam Mattress, Made in California, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNJGavIRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sierra combines traditional mattress craftsmanship with the comfort of gel memory foam. Hand-stitched tape edges and four-way stretch knit on top help you reap the full rewards of memory foam, keeping your mattress from bowing and supporting you fully every night and every morning. Most important, gel memory foam contours your entire body, with a ventilated foam layer keeping you cool. We called this our Sierra, because we were inspired by the active bodies that wake early and hike the hills around their homes. We think our Sierra will give you that bounce you need to get up and go. About Brentwood Home HEALTHY MATERIALS From our bedroom to our cities to the planet we call home, taking care of the spaces we inhabit is the foundation of our well-being. At Brentwood Home, much of the product development process is spent researching and sourcing materials ourselves, making sure they meet Golden State standards for environmental responsibility. HANDCRAFTING EXCELLENCE Brentwood Home has over 30 years of handcrafting experience here in Los Angeles, and our history has left us with an artisanal approach to manufacturing. From hand-tufted wool rosettes to beautiful quilted Euro-tops, you’ll be able to feel the attention to detail in every stitch. HONEST PRICES Our manufacturing experience allows us to control every aspect of production, and a lack of middle-men means affordable, honest prices. All of our mattresses ship free, with a 25-year warranty. CALIFORNIA ETHOS California has always been at the forefront of environmental regulation, implementing policies that are eventually followed by the rest of the country. We meet and exceed these standards by using a combination of organic, nontoxic, and natural materials with no chemical fire retardants, phthalates, or heavy metals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kNJGavIRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood Home","source_asin":"B01GFLDV12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFLDV12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFLDV12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534543,"name":"Holland Bar Stool Co. 620 Catalina Chair, Rein Thatch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PvM4d5u+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customize your very own chair with the help of Holland Bar Stool Co. This bronze Catalina chair has a contemporary design and provides superb back support for exceptional comfort. The frame is made from commercial quality 16 gauge, 1 1/4 inch tube steel with solid MIG welded joints to strength and durability. The powder coated finish resists chips and scratches and ensures a long-lasting, rich appearance. The wood seats are 1 1/4 inch solid hardwood (oak or Maple) and are dished for amazing posterior comfort, making sitting for minutes or hours a pleasure. The cushion seats are of the highest quality as well, utilizing a breathable, commercial grade vinyl or fabric. At the heart of the Cushion is 2 1/2 inches of highly-dense, us Made foam that provides maximum support and will not breakdown in a couple years. You won't find a higher quality chair on the market. If you are going to finish your dining area or just need a side chair - do it right, with a chair from the Holland Bar Stool Co. ** 5 year residential structural frame **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PvM4d5u+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holland Bar Stool Co.","source_asin":"B01KAXUQ64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KAXUQ64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KAXUQ64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534544,"name":"Christmas Decorations Christmas Lights,Halloween String Lights Battery Operated Halloween Lights Indoor Outdoor, 3M/10FT 30 LED Pumpkin Lights, Hallow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmUWJ7bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎃【Small Pumpkins with Brighter Halloween Lights】: Unlike those 20 LED halloween lights on the market, our string light is equipped with 30 interesting LED pumpkin lights. With more stable power and a larger number of LED beads, our delicate little pumpkins emits brighter lights at your Halloween night. The cute pumpkin smiley pattern with beautiful orange lights will bring everyone happy mood , which is definitely an excellent Halloween decoration for your house. 🎃【Halloween Decoration Indoor and Outdoor】: With IP44 waterproof design, you can decorate it indoors or outdoors. Pumpkin string lights is perfect for your Halloween party, carnival, celebrations, etc., which can be decorated in your mantelpiece, windows, stairs, bedroom, backyard, bushes, front door, corridor, camping tent, etc. It is great to enjoy the exciting festive atmosphere with your lovely family and friends. 🎃【Battery Powered + No Assembly Required】: Halloween led lights is powered by 3 * AA batteries (not included), which is more convenient than those by solar-powered or with plug. You can decorate it anywhere without being restricted to sockets or sunlight. In addition, our halloween pumpkin lights will save your time and energy because it can be directly decorated without complicated assembly steps. 🎃【8 Lighting Modes】: Different from others with only 2 modes, we prepare special 8 lighting modes for you: Combination, In wave, Sequential, Slo glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow fade, Twinkle/Flash,Steady on. You can easily switch the modes you like just with one button. Instead of monotonous modes, diversity lighting modes make your Halloween night more interesting and unique! 🎃【High-quality Materials + Safe Use】: Using high-quality copper wire solid plastic, the halloween light is easy to bend and durable for decoration. With low voltage and low power consumption, this pumpkin string lights will not easily heat up even if it lights for a long time during the party, which is safe for your family. If you have any questions after receiving the product, please communicate with us via email in time, you will get the best support and help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gmUWJ7bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LKESBO","source_asin":"B0972LVSNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972LVSNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972LVSNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
