window.products.push({"id":534621,"name":"GraTrend Compression Bags for Travel 10 Space Saver Bags for Travel, Roll-up Vacuum Bags for Travel, No Vacuum Pump Needed Vacuum Storage Bags for Lug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbbA0ijzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Different Sizes Space Saver Bags✔: 10 Pack- Includes 3 different Space saver bags sizes- 3 Large (24 x 16\"), 3 Medium (20 x 16\") and 4 Small (20 x 14\")- (Bottom air outlet width is about 1 inch), Providing a perfect storage solution for travel Compression 80% Space✔: Compression 80% valuable storage space in your future travels for additional clothes, blankets, pillows, towels and any other fabric accessories you can think of. Say goodbye to oversized bags - Easily pack all your wardrobe in your suitcase, briefcase, backpack or trolley Simple Operation✔: No Need for a Vacuum Pump- GraTrend’s reusable organizing storage bags were designed with one-way air outlet at the buttom, which allows airtight compression for saving space. Simply Place your clothes in the bag, Install the sealing slide tightly on the sealing zipper, Use the slider to tighten the zippers, roll the bag, and the excessive air will be easily released from the bottom part of the bag High Quality✔: GraTrend Vacuum Storage Bags are made with isolated, waterproof and reusable material(PE+ PA ), which will keep your clothes safe from dust, odors, to prevent it from damages. We paid special care to manufacture the highest quality sealing clips and zipper (Double Zipper) to make sure our bags NEVER leak and ensure a secure seal for optimal compression every time Multi-Use Compression Bags✔: You don't only save space, you can also isolate dirty clothes and bad smells when traveling as well as organize by outfit, activity or family member, Compress your clothes and luggage to a more compact size, reducing the original volume Perfect for Traveling, Camping, Backpacking, Hiking- Travel Must Haves","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LbbA0ijzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GraTrend","source_asin":"B0BCFRC5PN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCFRC5PN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCFRC5PN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
