window.products.push({"id":534623,"name":"Dear Mom, I'd Punch Another Mom In The Face Mug - 15oz Deluxe Double-Sided Coffee Tea Mug (White/Black Inlay)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PRcMKrmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT GIFT FOR THAT SPECIAL MOM IN YOUR LIFE -Parenting can be FUN(ny)! Our \"Dear Mom Thanks for being my mom...\" mug is the perfect way to tell Mom \"Thank You.\" DESIGNED WITH YOU IN MIND - We know that your time is valuable. Unlike most mugs which hold 11 ounces, we have printed our design on a mug which holds a generous 15 ounces of liquid, allowing you to pour and enjoy more. This extra-large high-fired ceramic mug, with easy-grip handle, will keep your morning dose of caffeine piping hot as you start your day. QUALITY MATTERS TO US - Our mugs are printed using high-definition graphics, detailed color contrast, and completed with a high gloss finish. Our wraparound design allows both right-handed and left-handed caffeine drinkers to show off this vibrant mug to family, friends, and coworkers. Additionally, our mugs are dishwasher and microwave safe, which allows you to enjoy them over and over again. PERFECT FOR MANY OCCASIONS - Our \"Dear Mom Thanks for being my mom...\" mug is a great way to highlight Mother's Day, birthdays, Holiday Celebrations, and Family Gatherings. YOUR SATISFACTION MATTERS - We are so confident in our mugs, we guarantee a One Year Limited Warranty. If the mug you ordered shows any signs of imperfection, fades, or cracks within a year of purchase, we will send you a replacement or provide a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PRcMKrmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artisan Owl","source_asin":"B07XC86ZX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XC86ZX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XC86ZX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
