window.products.push({"id":534684,"name":"Ticktime Pomodoro Timer, Productivity Timer Cube, Magnetic Flip Hexagon Timer, Mute & Adjustable Sound Alert, for Work, Office, ADHD, Study, Task, 3/5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IFT82kipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Creative Flip Countdown: Equipped with a precise gravity sensor system, you can quickly start the countdown by flipping the timer and turning the corresponding time number face up. Preset times: 3,5,10,15,25,30min. Easy to operate, allowing you to experience fun while managing time. Rechargeable battery: Built-in 500mAh rechargeable lithium battery, the timer can be used continuously for 10 hours after being fully charged. No need to replace the battery frequently, making your life more economical and environmentally friendly. Multiple functions: The timer can be used not only for custom countdown but also for timing , the maximum display time is 99:59. It has five levels of volume and mute mode, can be adjusted to meet all your needs, suitable for daily tasks management such as kitchen cooking, sports fitness, school education, business office, etc. Colorful LED Display: With LED high-definition electronic display, clear and easy to read, you can quickly check the time progress, battery power and volume, allowing you to manage the time to every second. Comfortable and Portable: Made of electroplated ABS material, the timer gives you a metal-like texture, prevents abrasion and scratches, and is more durable. The timer is light and small, very portable, weight: 0.012lb, size: 1.77*1.61*1.85inch. Fashionable and beautiful, it is a good gift for friends and family. What You Get: Ticktime timer*2, instruction manual, USB charging cable，our 12-month worry-free warranty and considerate customer service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact our after-sales service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IFT82kipL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ticktime","source_asin":"B09VT6XV5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VT6XV5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VT6XV5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534685,"name":"John Boos Block CCB183-S Classic Reversible Maple Wood End Grain Chopping Block, 18 Inches x 18 Inches x by 3 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":240.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmMtkiKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring home a culinary classic from the Classic Reversible End Grain Chopping Block collection by John Boos. The Classic collection features butcher blocks made with beautiful end grain construction, resulting in the iconic checkerboard wood pattern. Classic Reversible blocks are available in thicknesses ranging from 2.25-6 inches. True to their roots, Classic Collection Chopping Blocks are ideal for daily cutting, chopping and food preparation tasks. Since 1887, every genuine John Boos cutting board and butcher block has been proudly made in Effingham, Illinois by skilled craftspeople using time honored techniques. Today, USA made John Boos cutting boards and butcher blocks are used and loved in commercial and home kitchens worldwide. Generations of culinary professionals have trusted and relied on John Boos products, because Boos blocks and cutting boards are designed to meet the demanding requirements of culinary professionals who expect the highest level of quality and food safety standards. The robust and durable construction gives the work surface a commercial grade toughness that protects the sharp edge on fine cutlery. Often imitated, John Boos and Co. is internationally known for its expertise in crafting American hardwoods into products of beauty, durability and function. Simple board care can ensure this heirloom, handcrafted board is a favorite in your kitchen for years to come. Every John Boos Board and Block comes with a food safe natural oil finish that helps protect the wood during transit. Once a month, apply an even coat of John Boos Mystery Oil (NSF approved, sold separately), and allow it to soak in overnight. Repeat this process more often when the board is brand new or if you live in a dry, arid climate. John Boos recommends applying John Boos Board Cream (also sold separately) to seal the top of the wood surface after applying the Mystery Oil. A few quick minutes of regular oil application will ensure your new board is properly seasoned, and ready for work! After use, wash board with warm, soapy water (all wooden cutting boards are not dishwasher safe and should not be soaked in water)..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmMtkiKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"John Boos","source_asin":"B0BJ1DHW72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ1DHW72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ1DHW72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
