window.products.push({"id":534876,"name":"Rustic State Industrial Decor Wall Mount Floating Shelf with Iron Pipe Brackets 30 Inch Reclaimed Wood Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvcOypgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Search Ends Here… Tidy Up Your Media Stand with this Budget Friendly Floating Shelf and Organize Your Books, CDs or DVDs with Ease. Multi-Purpose Storage Solution: If you want to decorate and organize your home at the same time, this rustic wall décor is amazingly organizational. The functional brackets with curved hooks will give you the flexibility to hang a few things while organizing and displaying your other essential needs on the top. Use this floating shelf in your kitchen, bathroom, living room, entryway, home office, or even in your restaurant, café, bar and business. Don’t hesitate to spunk up your walls and functionally organize for a fraction of the cost, you can add sophistication and style simply by hanging this bookshelf on your empty wall space. Complete the design of your home by decorating your walls. Nifty Kitchen Organizer: With this reclaimed wood and stylish floating shelf you can organize and tidy up your kitchen counter top, cabinets, drawers and even pantry. Add extra storage solution to your small kitchen, you can store this shelf by your stove to pots, pans and spices within reach. Order now in the comfort of your home and have it delivered to your door step without lifting a foot. Specifications: Material: Reclaimed Wood Color: Walnut Product Measurements: 30” x 10.5” x 0.75” Please Note: Due to monitor variations colors may appear slightly different. Package Content Information: 1 30” Living Room Rustic Home Décor Floating Bookshelf with 2 Iron Pipe Brackets and Mounting Hardware","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WvcOypgNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rustic State","source_asin":"B0762VSYKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0762VSYKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0762VSYKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":534877,"name":"VSUDO 17.7\" x 78.7\" No Glue Static Cling Privacy Window Film, Iron Art Pattern Home Decor Window Tint Sticker (9.69 sq. ft)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZnIAenqaS._AC_SL1340_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. VSUDO decorative privacy window film can help us to make it happen. The window film can protect our privacy and keep home or office bright. Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use window films on window glass of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding door window, french window, cabinet panel. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Step: 1. Cut film to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle wet the glass with water, more water more better (JUST WATER, NOT USE GLASS CLEANER) 4. Peel off the back protective film (Sometime you will find it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides with adhesive tape then peel off) 5. Stick film on glass (Put the smooth side to window, don’t put the frosted side to the window) 6. Scrape a few more times with squeegee or abandoned credit cards to ensure the bubbles and water are completely removed 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 1 Roll Window Film: 17.7 by 78.7 inches (45 X 200CM), 9.69 sq. ft Tips: 1. This film is suitable for smooth, flat clean glass surface. Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other material. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before install. 4. Use a hair dryer to soften the film under cold weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZnIAenqaS._AC_SL1340_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B08LQS22V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LQS22V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LQS22V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
