window.products.push({"id":534923,"name":"Morzaldo Macrame Wall Hanging Extra Large Boho Decor 47Wx45H with Dowel - Hand Woven Bohemian Tapestry Wall Hangings, Unique Housewarming Gift, Boho T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1YD6pLojIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you stressed and tired from your work and duties? Do you want to get some rest in a good vibe? Put this Extra Large Bohemian Macrame Wall Hanging in your living room or bedroom adds some calming natural texture to your home. This boho wall decor creates a relaxing space that gives off an air of spa-like tranquility, giving you a state of calm away from your busy life. The size of this boho decor XL is approximately 45H x 47W inches. It is large enough to cover a good portion of your wall. This boho wall hanging is hand-made by our dedicated Artisans, who have over 20 years of experience. The natural cotton and wooden dowel bring your home elements of nature. The boho tapestry consists of 3 parts (Left, Center, Right). You can screw the dowels together easily. The 3-part wooden dowel is good in quality and \"Straight-Guarantee\". A hanging string is attached to help you hang the boho wall art up easily. (*hooks are not included)A High-Quality Stainless Steel Comb is our gift for you to take care of the macrame decor. The bohemian wall decor is well packed with beautiful tissue paper in a gift box. It is gift-friendly for housewarming, Christmas, Mother's day, or as a wedding decoration.We offer 1 Year Warranty and 30-Day Hassle-Free Return. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, you can return it within 30 days for a refund. If you have any questions, please don’t hesitate to contact us. You can also go to our website to see more FAQs, installation instructions, and caring tips for your boho wall decor. We are always here to support you and make sure you are happy.Get this Extra Large Macrame Wall Hanging NOW and immerse yourself into the Calming Bohemian Vibe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1YD6pLojIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09KFZLRFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KFZLRFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KFZLRFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
