window.products.push({"id":534989,"name":"Pints & Lids Bundle - Stainless Steel Pint Glasses: Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Metal Cups to Keep Drinks Cold or Hot - Set of 4 Rimless, Sweat Free ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMMAzHyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Love a cold, refreshing pint—no matter where you are? Beer glasses break and aren’t convenient for outdoors. Plastic cups create lots of waste and aren’t good for the environment. Not to worry—this set of 4 Stainless Steel Pint Glasses from Real Deal Steel is just the solution. Lightweight yet made of solid, food-grade stainless steel, our 16 oz. cups are just the right size to hold a bottle of your favorite brew (including the foam). They’re double-walled and vacuum insulated to keep your beer frosty and delicious without making your hands wet from condensation. Plus, these steel tumblers aren’t just for cold drinks like beer, cocktails & smoothies. Their insulated design also keeps coffee, tea & hot cocoa steaming hot and delicious. 4 tumblers, 16 oz. capacity each. Made of 100% 18/8 stainless steel .Double-walled to preserve hot / cold temps. Rimless to prevent build-up. Sweatproof, rustproof. Dishwasher-safe. Nest partially to save space. Eco-friendly. Individually vacuum-sealed. Real Deal Steel Stainless Steel Pint Glasses look stylish and modern thanks to their brushed exterior—which also makes them easy to grip. The polished interior won’t make your beverage taste funny or transfer flavors from previous drinks. They are slim and feel great in your hand while still keeping your drink icy-cold. Great Gift Idea: This set is a practical and unique gift for someone who loves beer, coffee or the outdoors (and don’t forget to grab a set for yourself). The 4 lids included are splashproof, spill resistant and will extend insulation time. Protects drinks from debris while using outdoor on the patio, camping, poolside, on a boat, at the beach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aMMAzHyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Real Deal Steel","source_asin":"B08BMSFF8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-534989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BMSFF8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BMSFF8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
